ule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"LAW50014","name":"法律实务","credits":2.0,"required":false,"term":"7","rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"LAW50061","name":"检察业务专题","credits":2.0,"required":false,"term":"7","rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"LAW50065","name":"案例研讨","credits":2.0,"required":false,"term":"春,秋","rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"LAW50066","name":"法学生的生涯规划与就业指导","credits":2.0,"required":false,"term":"春,秋","rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}}]},{"id":"-101","rawId":"-101","parent":null,"level":"1.1.1","title":"荣誉项目路径","type":null,"rule":{"requiredSubModuleNum":0,"requiredCredits":0.0,"postCreditsRequired":0.0,"postRequiredCourseNum":0,"integrationCreditsRequired":0.0,"integrationRequiredCourseNum":0,"requiredCourseNum":0,"autoSubModuleNum":false,"showRequiredCredits":"0","requireAll":false,"requireAny":true},"limit":{"creditsUpperLimit":null,"courseNumUpperLimit":null},"note":"修读荣誉课程的学分数不低于24分，课程门数不少于6门，且其中6门成绩不低于A-。在带“*”号的6门荣誉课程中至少修读4门，且满足专业进阶模块修读不少于应修学分1/2的修读要求， 荣誉项目课程设置和修读要求请见法学院本科“荣誉项目”实施方案。下载地址：https://jwc.fudan.edu.cn/（复旦大学教务处）-专业培养-常用文档。","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[]},{"id":"3","rawId":"3","parent":null,"level":"1.1.1","title":"跨学科发展路径","type":null,"rule":{"requiredSubModuleNum":0,"requiredCredits":0.0,"postCreditsRequired":0.0,"postRequiredCourseNum":0,"integrationCreditsRequired":0.0,"integrationRequiredCourseNum":0,"requiredCourseNum":0,"autoSubModuleNum":false,"showRequiredCredits":"30","requireAll":false,"requireAny":true},"limit":{"creditsUpperLimit":null,"courseNumUpperLimit":null},"note":"修满30学分。要求修读2个非本专业独立开设的微专业（学程），可选择专业微专业（学程）或跨学科微专业（学程）。学分不足部分可在全校所有本科生课程中任意选修。\n微专业（学程）课程详见教务处微专业（学程）项目网页，下载地址：https://jwc.fudan.edu.cn/（复旦大学教务处）-专业培养-常用文档。完成微专业（学程）修读要求的学生可获得相应的微专业（学程）证书。","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[]},{"id":"5","rawId":"5","parent":null,"level":"1.1.1","title":"创新创业路径","type":null,"rule":{"requiredSubModuleNum":0,"requiredCredits":0.0,"postCreditsRequired":0.0,"postRequiredCourseNum":0,"integrationCreditsRequired":0.0,"integrationRequiredCourseNum":0,"requiredCourseNum":0,"autoSubModuleNum":false,"showRequiredCredits":"30","requireAll":false,"requireAny":true},"limit":{"creditsUpperLimit":null,"courseNumUpperLimit":null},"note":"修满30学分。要求修读1个创新创业学院开设的创新创业微专业（学程），以及1个非本专业独立开设的微专业（学程）。修读学分不足部分可在全校所有本科生课程中任意选修。创新创业微专业（学程）课程详见教务处微专业（学程）项目网页，下载地址：https://jwc.fudan.edu.cn/（复旦大学教务处）-专业培养-常用文档。","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[]},{"id":"21","rawId":"21","parent":null,"level":"1.1.1","title":"辅修学士学位路径","type":null,"rule":{"requiredSubModuleNum":0,"requiredCredits":0.0,"postCreditsRequired":0.0,"postRequiredCourseNum":0,"integrationCreditsRequired":0.0,"integrationRequiredCourseNum":0,"requiredCourseNum":0,"autoSubModuleNum":false,"showRequiredCredits":"52","requireAll":false,"requireAny":true},"limit":{"creditsUpperLimit":null,"courseNumUpperLimit":null},"note":"要求至少修读本专业进阶课程12学分和1个辅修学士学位项目，辅修学士学位应与主修学士学位归属不同的本科专业大类。\n辅修学士学位项目课程设置详见教务处辅修学士学位项目网页，下载地址：https://jwc.fudan.edu.cn/（复旦大学教务处）-专业培养-常用文档。完成辅修学士学位项目修读要求，且达到学校毕业和学位授予要求的学生可获得相应的辅修学士学位证书。","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[]},{"id":"-100","rawId":"-100","parent":null,"level":"1.1.1","title":"其他","type":null,"rule":{"requiredSubModuleNum":0,"requiredCredits":0.0,"postCreditsRequired":0.0,"postRequiredCourseNum":0,"integrationCreditsRequired":0.0,"integrationRequiredCourseNum":0,"requiredCourseNum":0,"autoSubModuleNum":false,"showRequiredCredits":"0","requireAll":false,"requireAny":true},"limit":{"creditsUpperLimit":null,"courseNumUpperLimit":null},"note":"","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[]},{"id":"2~22","rawId":"2","parent":null,"level":"1.1","title":"融合创新能力","type":null,"rule":{"requiredSubModuleNum":0,"requiredCredits":8.0,"postCreditsRequired":0.0,"postRequiredCourseNum":0,"integrationCreditsRequired":0.0,"integrationRequiredCourseNum":0,"requiredCourseNum":0,"autoSubModuleNum":false,"showRequiredCredits":"8","requireAll":false,"requireAny":true},"limit":{"creditsUpperLimit":null,"courseNumUpperLimit":null},"note":"1. 学院注重价值引领与人格养成，为每一位本科生全学程、分阶段配备一位导师，为学生全面发展提供个性化指导，打造共建共享的师生学术和文化共同体。\n2. 通过复芏计划等项目引导学生在“做中学、学中悟、悟中创”，激发创新志趣。鼓励学生参加国际交流，提升学生的国际视野和跨文化交际能力。鼓励学生参加专业竞赛，以赛促教、促学。","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[{"code":"105","name":"全员全过程导师制","credits":0.0,"required":true,"term":null,"rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"7","name":"国际交流","credits":0.0,"required":false,"term":null,"rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"106","name":"专业竞赛(本科阶段)","credits":0.0,"required":false,"term":null,"rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"102","name":"复芏计划(FDUROP)","credits":0.0,"required":false,"term":null,"rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"LAW40002","name":"毕业实习","credits":4.0,"required":true,"term":"8","rule":{"requiredCourse":false,"integrationCompulsory":false,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"LAW40007","name":"毕业论文","credits":4.0,"required":true,"term":"8","rule":{"requiredCourse":false,"integrationCompulsory":false,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}}]}],"rowCount":85,"completeModules":true,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-31T16:43:47Z","programNotes":[{"title":"学科专业简介","text":"复旦大学的法科教育始于 1905 年，1914 年启动成建制招生，1929年正式建院。现已建成完整的本硕博人才培养体系，现有国家级一流本科专业、上海市一流学科（上海市重点学科），获批设立“复合型”和“涉外型”两个教育部卓越法律人才教育培养基地、教育部涉外法治人才协同培养创新基地和两个上海市卓越法律人才培养基地。以学科交叉、国际视野和实践导向为特色，推进“法学+”交叉学科建设、推进涉外法治研究和合作，推进面向实践的法律人才培养，致力于打造具有中国特色的一流法学学科。"},{"title":"培养目标","text":"&nbsp;按照“宽口径、厚基础、重能力、求创新”的人才培养要求，以“2+X+Y”（2是通识和专业教育，X是多元发展路径，Y为融合创新能力）为途径，培养德智体美劳全面发展的卓越法治人才。学生应具有良好的思想道德素质和科学的世界观，具有人文情怀，具备突出的法律素养与创新思维、开阔的国际视野与跨文化交流合作能力，能够在国家机关、企事业单位、有关涉外机构和社会团体、特别是能在立法机关、行政机关、检察机关、审判机关、仲裁机构和法律服务部门从事相关工作，服务国家重大战略需求。"},{"title":"基本要求","text":""},{"title":"修业要求","text":"\n\n\n1.修业年限：4年（类型：√本科、□本硕、□本博）\n&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n\n\n2.&nbsp;学位授予说明：\n\n\n/\n/\n授予学位\n学位类型\n专业名称\n学段审核要求\n\n\n/\n/\n法学学士\n/\n法学\n□按照不少于总学分比例____%\n\n\n√按照不少于学分数 124\n\n\n√必修课组须通过\n通识教育课程26学分\n\n\n专业培养课程66学分\n\n\n专业进阶模块24学分\n\n\n融合创新能力模块8学分\n\n\n□其他____________________\n\n\n"},{"title":"学分要求","text":"&nbsp;\n1、 专业进阶路径：124学分&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;\n2、 本科荣誉项目&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n在专业进阶路径基础上，修读荣誉课程不少于6门课。荣誉项目课程设置和修读要求请见法学院“本科荣誉项目”实施方案。下载地址：https://jwc.fudan.edu.cn/（复旦大学教务处）专业培养-常用文档。鼓励学生选择荣誉项目。 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;"},{"title":"学位要求","text":"本科学位&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n1. 4年级结束时，如达到学士学位要求者授予法学学士学位。\n（1）修满规定的学分，达到本科教学培养方案规定的各项要求。&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n（2）以符合学生毕业时所在专业教学培养方案规定的所有课程的有效成绩为准计算平均绩点，且此平均绩点大于或等于2.0。&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n&nbsp;（3）在此基础上，达到法学“本科荣誉证书”获得条件的授予“本科荣誉证书”，具体要求请见法学“本科荣誉项目”实施方案。&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;"},{"title":"课程体系与科研训练体系","text":"&nbsp;\n\n1.课程体系&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n法学专业核心课程采取“1+10+X”分类设置模式，以19门课程为基础，建立了符合法学知识教学规律的专业核心课程体系。为鼓励学生多元发展，学生可自行选择修读X课程模块。鼓励学生修读荣誉课程。&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n2.科研训练体系&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n建立螺旋递进的全周期科研训练体系，分年级为全体本科生配备学院导师、书院导师，鼓励师生共创，通过复芏计划等项目引导学生在“做中学、学中悟、悟中创”，激发创新志趣。鼓励学生参加国际交流，提升学生的国际视野和跨文化交际能力。鼓励学生参加专业竞赛，以赛促教、促学。"},{"title":"课程设置与修读要求","text":"备注：每学期选修学分不得超过32学分。"}]}